('127.164.d.7.D',3,'An acceptable use policy tells students how to:','["Park cars", "Use school technology responsibly", "Cook lunch", "Build robots"]'::jsonb,1,'AUP.','original'),
('127.164.d.7.D',4,'Proper network etiquette includes:','["Sharing passwords", "Streaming during class", "Respectful messages and no unauthorized downloads", "Hiding browsing"]'::jsonb,2,'Etiquette.','original'),
