('127.164.d.9.A',4,'Before a video review, the presenter should test the:','["Microphone and screen sharing", "Lights in the hall", "Door lock", "Printer"]'::jsonb,0,'Preparing communication.','original'),
('127.164.d.9.B',3,'Choosing a close-up to show a character''s face is a decision about:','["Printing", "Framing", "Pricing", "Filing"]'::jsonb,1,'Production elements.','original'),
